"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Taps and gestures / Gesture overview"
msgstr ""
"MENU PRINCIPAL / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Appuis et gestes / Présentation des gestes"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5785-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> When "
"chooosing an action for a gesture, you will see a special item in the list "
"named <span class=\"ui\">pass through</span>. This action is used to keep "
"the default behavior of that gesture, like text selection when long pressing "
"near the corners. If you want to disable a gesture to avoid accidental "
"actions, choose <span class=\"ui\">nothing</span> as the action. In other "
"words <span class=\"ui\">pass through</span>=<b>another handler might act on "
"it</b>, <span class=\"ui\">nothing</span>=<b>swallow the action</b>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> "
"Lorsque vous choisissez une action pour un geste, vous verrez dans la liste "
"un élément spécial intitulé <span class=\"ui\">pass through</span>. Cette "
"action permet de conserver le comportement par défaut de ce geste, comme la "
"sélection de texte lors d'un appui long près des coins. Si vous souhaitez "
"désactiver un geste pour éviter toute action accidentelle, choisissez <span "
"class=\"ui\">rien</span> comme action. En d’autres termes, <span "
"class=\"ui\">pass through</span> = <b>un autre gestionnaire pourrait "
"intervenir</b>, <span class=\"ui\">rien</span> = <b>ignorer l’action</b>."

